   - If your device has a camera, it will activate automatically and display a QR code that you scan.  
   - If you can’t scan, you’ll be prompted to type the session code manually.  
3. Once the QR code or session code is scanned/entered, your attendance status is recorded (Present, Late, Absent, etc.) and saved in the system.

